  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nA = [50 - 4 × 5 + {6 ÷ 3 - 1}]\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nA = [50 - 4 × 5 + {6 ÷ 3 - 1}]\n\n⇒ A = [50 - 4 × 5 + {2 - 1}]\n\n⇒ A = [50 - 4 × 5 + 1]\n\n⇒ A = [50 - 20 + 1]\n\n⇒ A = 31\n\n**∴ Option 3 is the correct answer.**",
